  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 92c1dbeb923a6fb4fa7d81aa6eba722b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: You tear down the notice and kick the door open, scattering a stack of
      enveloped that were resting against it.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 201f6469e4184ed47ad1425f0931fb16, type: 2}
  - text: You are greeted by a trashed foyer, with tables and chairs strewn about
      the room.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 201f6469e4184ed47ad1425f0931fb16, type: 2}
  - text: Muttering draws your attention to the kitchen, where a familiar shape is
      curled up behind the counter.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 201f6469e4184ed47ad1425f0931fb16, type: 2}
  - text: You kneel down in front of him.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 201f6469e4184ed47ad1425f0931fb16, type: 2}
  - text: Cas?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8d3fe80becf898a46ad20a3c04d47cf7, type: 2}
  - text: (Incoherent mumbling)
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ec0f790e6c3817c42a746737784f010a, type: 2}
  - text: You place a hand on his shoulder and he jolts, head snapping up to look
      at you.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 201f6469e4184ed47ad1425f0931fb16, type: 2}
  - text: -or at least, he would, if he had eyes.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 201f6469e4184ed47ad1425f0931fb16, type: 2}
  - text: Despite his visual impairment, it only takes a moment for the knight to
      recognise you.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 201f6469e4184ed47ad1425f0931fb16, type: 2}
  - text: ...My liege? Is it really you?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ec0f790e6c3817c42a746737784f010a, type: 2}
  - text: In the flesh. What happened here
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8d3fe80becf898a46ad20a3c04d47cf7, type: 2}
  - text: Well... when you didn't show up for work, the others decided to take an
      extended vacation.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ec0f790e6c3817c42a746737784f010a, type: 2}
  - text: All at once.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ec0f790e6c3817c42a746737784f010a, type: 2}
  - text: Not everyone though! Marchosias and I tried to keep business running in
      your absence, but alas... we were unsuccessful.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ec0f790e6c3817c42a746737784f010a, type: 2}
  - text: My deepest apologies.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ec0f790e6c3817c42a746737784f010a, type: 2}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d0bfd24f10147b34c8273656b715f915, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 0}
